  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mi Escuela Progresa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">My School is Making Progress</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar la implementacin de la poltica educativa del pas, en especial en el nivel de educacin primaria, para lograr una educacin de calidad con equidad, pertinencia cultural y lingstica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the country&apos;s education policy, especially at the preprimary and primary levels, in order to improve quality and equity in a context of a pluricultural society.</narrative>
  </description>
